{"slug":"MENA","title":"MENA","cats":[],"headings":[{"id":"Map_nations","text":"Nations","level":2},{"id":"Map_data","text":"Map data","level":2},{"id":"Technical","text":"Technical","level":2}],"html":"<p><a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">Map</a> of Middle East and North Africa, with some parts of Southern Europe visible. Mostly hilly <a href=\"/Terrain\" title=\"Terrain\">terrain</a> with most of the mountains present in the northern part of the <a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">map</a>. There are some water and rivers.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/MENA_map.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"280\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"2200\" data-file-height=\"964\"><figcaption>The Mena map, from the <a href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/tree/main/map-generator/assets/maps/mena\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenFront game files</a>.</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Map_nations\">Nations</h2></div>\n<p>The map features 35 named <a href=\"/Nations\" title=\"Nations\">nations</a>, including Spain, Portugal, Morocco, Algeria, Tunisia and Libyan Arab Jamahiriya.</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Map_data\">Map data</h2></div>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Categories:</b> Asia, Africa</li>\n<li><b>Nations:</b> 35</li>\n<li><b>Public rotation frequency:</b> 6</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Technical\">Technical</h2></div><p>\nThe size of the <a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">map</a> is 2200 x 964.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></p><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/300px-Mena_height_map.webp.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"131\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"550\" data-file-height=\"241\"><figcaption><a href=